    <!-- REQUIRED HERE, in the app (#220). The Core Audio tap is created by the XPC helper, but TCC
         attributes System Audio Recording to the HOST APP: the prompt names Parley.app and shows
         THIS string. Without it macOS never prompts, the permission stays undetermined forever, and
         the tap silently records digital zeros. Verified by device spike 2026-09-23. -->
    <key>NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Parley needs System Audio Recording permission to capture meeting and call audio (including Continuity calls).</string>

    <key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Parley uses your calendar to suggest a name for the recording based on your current meeting.</string>

